flowchart LR
  SEMA[Semantic syntax and resolved binding/control rules] --> BUILD[Owned expression declaration and statement graphs]
  BUILD --> LOAD[Explicit scalar loads addresses and conversions]
  BUILD --> INIT[Active typed initialization actions]
  BUILD --> CONTROL[Owned scopes labels loops and switch plans]
  SEMA --> CONSTANT[Checked static data and relocation construction]
  CONSTANT --> OBJECT[HIR owned typed static objects]
  LOAD --> VERIFY[Owned references types and graph invariants]
  INIT --> VERIFY
  CONTROL --> VERIFY
  OBJECT --> VERIFY
  VERIFY --> IR[CFG effects with independent parameter and static-data ownership]
  VERIFY --> DUMP[Stable IDs source origins and actual plans]
  IR --> INTERP[Interpreter after AST and HIR retirement]
  IR --> NATIVE[Original native objects and reference behavior]
